{"3921650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sign My Petition", "steam_appid": 3921650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4923030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/122ecf7021a5de6b177d93b83d5edacd.poster.avif?t=1787508512\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/122ecf7021a5de6b177d93b83d5edacd.webm?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/122ecf7021a5de6b177d93b83d5edacd.mp4?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chosen One, champion of his mouse tribe, must stop the Exterminator. He travels through a crumbling apartment building collecting ritual signatures from human tenants. To earn them, he battles gangs of ants, deals with eccentric residents, and meets other mouse tribes each struggling with their own strange problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/8e61d432beceb1c165da14c640c9f1a8.poster.avif?t=1787508512\" width=560 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/8e61d432beceb1c165da14c640c9f1a8.webm?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/8e61d432beceb1c165da14c640c9f1a8.mp4?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Of questionable proportions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are hammers huge and the flamethrowers tiny? Don’t worry about it. Just use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/ac88017161932fdab495aa909dd77a09.poster.avif?t=1787508512\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/ac88017161932fdab495aa909dd77a09.webm?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/ac88017161932fdab495aa909dd77a09.mp4?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ hand-drawn residents with personalities, problems, and weird moments you’ll stumble into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/cec5ba21e6e56ac25b65fb47952f63c1.poster.avif?t=1787508512\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/cec5ba21e6e56ac25b65fb47952f63c1.webm?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/cec5ba21e6e56ac25b65fb47952f63c1.mp4?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most characters can be talked to or interacted with in simple ways. They’ll react differently depending on what you do, and some don’t forget. So… try not to hand out too many black eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/23ea1dc555644a7dd58004deea9c8f33.poster.avif?t=1787508512\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/23ea1dc555644a7dd58004deea9c8f33.webm?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/23ea1dc555644a7dd58004deea9c8f33.mp4?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and buy items that will power-up certain attacks. Hot sauce makes kicks explosive. Roach milk, as expected, super-charges your uppercut.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/122ecf7021a5de6b177d93b83d5edacd.poster.avif?t=1787508512\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/122ecf7021a5de6b177d93b83d5edacd.webm?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921650/extras/122ecf7021a5de6b177d93b83d5edacd.mp4?t=1787508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chosen One, champion of his mouse tribe, must stop the Exterminator. He travels through a crumbling apartment building collecting ritual signatures from human tenants. To earn them, he battles gangs of ants, deals with eccentric residents, and meets other mouse tribes each struggling with their own strange problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=